                                "sense_id": "facbe700-dce6-3c12-bd33-a610f6b12b7b",
                                "text": "Many courses are given to aspiring scientists as introductory statistics or biometrics introducing elementary statistical methodology. The objective, however, is not to help budding statisticians to statisticize but to help experimental scientists to experiment properly."
